{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":39,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比倫的使者"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時，巴拉但的兒子巴比倫王米羅達·巴拉但聽說希西迦患病及痊癒的事，便派人送來書信和禮物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["希西迦欣然接見使者，讓他們觀看國庫裡的金銀、香料、珍貴膏油、所有兵器和一切寶物。希西迦把宮中及國內的一切悉數給他們看。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["以賽亞先知來見希西迦王，問他：「這些人說了些什麼？他們從哪裡來？」 希西迦答道：「他們來自遙遠的巴比倫。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["以賽亞問：「他們在你宮裡看到了什麼？」 希西迦答道：「他們看到了我宮中的一切。我把國庫裡的一切悉數給他們看了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以賽亞對希西迦說：「你要聽萬軍之耶和華的話，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["『看啊，時候快到了，你宮中的一切和你祖先積攢到現在的一切必被擄到巴比倫，一件不留。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你自己親生的子孫中必有人被擄去，在巴比倫王的宮中做太監。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["希西迦對以賽亞說：「耶和華藉你說的話很好。」因為他想：「我有生之年將平安穩妥。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/39.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/40.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/38.json","previousChapterAudioLinks"